  <name>Akhenaten</name>
  <summary>Open-source engine for Pharaoh (1999)</summary>

  <metadata_license>FSFAP</metadata_license>
  <project_license>AGPL-3.0-only</project_license>

  <description>
    <p>
      Akhenaten is an open-source reimplementation of the classic city-builder Pharaoh
      (1999), including Cleopatra expansion support. It aims for compatibility with
      original savegames and campaign missions on modern systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      You need a legal copy of Pharaoh (and Cleopatra, if used). Point Akhenaten at your
      game data directory, or place the files where the engine can find them.
    </p>
  </description>

